      "structure_description": "The centrosymmetric, nanoscale rectangular cluster (approximately 1.3 × 2.8 × 3.1 nm) consists of two equivalent Zn11Nd13 moieties linked by two Schiff base ligands. Within each moiety, a central carbonate connects five Nd(III) and two Zn(II) ions to form a Zn2Nd5 core; carbonate, hydroxide and acetate oxygen atoms bridge neighboring metals.",
